title: "capability-profiles-hf"
abstract: >-
  Reads LLM benchmark scores as capability profiles rather than rankings:
  what Hugging Face leaderboard results measure about a model, and what
  they leave out. Companion code to "LLM Benchmarks as Cognitive
  Inventories: What They Measure and What They Miss."
